	('232953', '71771', '131', 'HELM BAY CABIN', 'Campground', '2336', 'Tongass National Forest', 55.62826, -131.9772, true, NULL, NULL, 'Overview Helm Bay Cabin is located on the west shore of Helm Bay behind Forss Island. This rustic retreat is open year-round for relaxation and recreational use in Alaska''s beautiful
