	('232952', '71770', '131', 'HECKMAN LAKE CABIN', 'Campground', '2336', 'Tongass National Forest', 55.585, -131.54155, true, NULL, NULL, 'Overview Heckman Lake Cabin is located in the Naha Recreation Area at the end of the Naha River National Recreation Trail. The cabin is open year-round, offering opportunities 
